# Broadside Barrage (cast in Bot2's end step on turn 2 with three Moxen) deals 5 damage to Bot2's Brazen Borrower (3/1), which
# dies; then Bot1 draws a card (the Swamp on top of the library) and discards a card of its choice, the Forest. In that order:
# the draw comes first, so the Swamp is in the hand to choose from (the discard of the Swamp itself is the other answer).

